[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=New windows almost maximized
Name[es]=Ventanas nuevas casi maximizadas
Comment=Opens each new window in the "full" region of its monitor (docs/5-desktop/3-windows-and-shortcuts.md)
Comment[es]=Abre cada ventana nueva en la región "full" (llena) de su monitor (receta de Void, paso 13)
Exec=@TARGET_HOME@/.local/bin/new-windows
OnlyShowIn=XFCE;
X-XFCE-Autostart-Override=true
